    {
      "source": "Resolves the permitted level of access for the endpoint with the given\n<code>endpointId</code> and <code>defaultAccess</code>.",
      "translation": "解决给定 `<code>endpointId</code>` 和 `<code>defaultAccess</code>` 的端点的允许访问级别。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "<a href=\"../../endpoint/EndpointAccessResolver.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.boot.actuate.endpoint\"><code>EndpointAccessResolver</code></a> that resolves the permitted level of access to an\nendpoint using the following properties:\n<ol>\n<li><code>management.endpoint.&lt;id&gt;.access</code> or <code>management.endpoint.&lt;id&gt;.enabled</code>\n(deprecated)\n</li><li><code>management.endpoints.access.default</code> or\n<code>management.endpoints.enabled-by-default</code> (deprecated)\n</li></ol>\nThe resulting access is capped using <code>management.endpoints.access.max-permitted</code>.",
      "translation": "<a href=\"../../endpoint/EndpointAccessResolver.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.boot.actuate.endpoint\"><code>EndpointAccessResolver</code></a> 用于解析对端点的允许访问级别，使用以下属性：\n<ol>\n<li><code>management.endpoint.&lt;id&gt;.access</code> 或 <code>management.endpoint.&lt;id&gt;.enabled</code>（已弃用）\n</li><li><code>management.endpoints.access.default</code> 或\n<code>management.endpoints.enabled-by-default</code>（已弃用）\n</li></ol>\n最终访问级别受 <code>management.endpoints.access.max-permitted</code> 限制。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
